# VAT API manual smoke tests
# Format validation = no network
# VIES check = live external check

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7297

@hrVat = HR43118119983
@deVat = DE123475223
@atVat = ATU14194708
@siVat = SI80267432

### HR - format validation only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vat/validate/{{hrVat}}
### HR - format + VIES live check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vat/check/{{hrVat}}

### DE - format validation only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vat/validate/{{deVat}}

### DE - format + VIES live check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vat/check/{{deVat}}


### AT - format validation only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vat/validate/{{atVat}}

### AT - format + VIES live check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vat/check/{{atVat}}

### SI - format validation only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vat/validate/{{siVat}}

### SI - format + VIES live check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vat/check/{{siVat}}